    "title": "Girl abducted by non-custodial father in West County found safe, suspect still at-large, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By First Alert 4 Staff ,\n3 hours ago ST. LOUIS, Mo. (First Alert 4) - The search is on for a man who police say stabbed the mother of his daughter and then abducted the child in West County Wednesday. Police say they are looking for Munyaradzi Chiturumani,m 36. Authorities say he took Rudo Chiturumani, 8, from Shadycreek Court in unincorporated St. Louis County and stabbed her mother. The incident happened around 1:00 pm. Wednesday. Read full article\n5",
